WEBVTT

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:40.050
The water flows, and the clouds
pursue the white puppet.

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:44.480
The curtain rises... on the climax.

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:26.850
<b>We're just about
to reach the coordinates.</b>

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:28.530
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:31.770
<b>Somehow, it feels kinda strange.</b>

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:33.270
<b>I know what you mean.</b>

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:37.840
<b>Maybe this is what that line "I have
the ecstasy and the terror" is about.</b>

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:40.080
<b>10. The Curtain Rises
on the Climax</b>

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.430
<b>- Who said that?
- Dunno.</b>

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:44.030
<b>- Where's Fena?
- I haven't seen her. Her cabin, maybe?</b>

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.290
Fena!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.500
We're almost there.
Let's go.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:56.930
Sure.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.120
- Fena.
- Yes?

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.280
- It's almost over.
- Yeah.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:08.560
- I'm a little nervous.
- Yeah.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.680
- Do you think it'll really be there? Eden?
- Probably.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.320
Ah.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.070
- Something's waiting there.
- Yeah.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.880
Sorry. None of this makes
any sense, does it?

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.070
I'm used to it.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.630
Think that's it?

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:34.580
It's not quite what I pictured.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.590
- It's so dang tiny!
- It sure is.

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:40.370
Did we get something wrong?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:41.090
Fena?

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.270
Maybe we were supposed to
reverse the reverse?

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.700
- I guess we'll just have to turn around.
- You're probably right.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:49.850
Fena?

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.100
- Hey, Fena.
- It's coming.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.870
Coming? What's coming?

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.360
- What's that?
- An earthquake?

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.490
What in the--

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.270
An island...

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.770
...came out of nowhere!

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.730
Wh-What the hell is that?!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.490
It was waiting...

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.490
...for Fena to come?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.490
So somewhere on this island...

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:52.990
...is Eden?

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:56.000
Everybody, let's go.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.470
Would you get a load of this!

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:10.470
There's so much white
it's making my eyes hurt.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.380
Fena!

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.810
Don't worry. It's this way.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:19.830
Follow me!

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.280
She isn't acting like she did
that last time.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.380
It doesn't feel like
she's being controlled.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.020
I guess it's like Fena said.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:31.830
"When I've made the right choice,
someone will come tell me."

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.100
- Who?
- I have no idea.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.330
Ah.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.880
- Oh, wow!
- I've never seen trees like these before.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.520
This is something else!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:53.640
This color isn't one of those that have
an effect on the human body, right?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.430
- If Tsubaki passes out, let's bolt.
- Yeah.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.190
- Oh, wow!
- They're huge!

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.130
Fena. Are you sure
this is the place?

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.620
Yeah, I think.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.140
There's nothing here
but waterfalls, though.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.730
If something is here,
maybe it's behind a waterfall?

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:22.700
- Let's check it out.
- You're up, antlings!

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:23.650
On it!

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:30.350
Which do you think it is?

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.260
Kaede's waterfall, maybe?

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.070
Wow, good call.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.490
Let's go.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:44.020
Well I'll be.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:46.900
Somebody sure is raring to go.

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:51.910
Kaede! Lower a rope!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:59.220
- Not another cave...
- Shall we light some torches?

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:02.120
Once our eyes adjust,
we should be fine without them.

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:13.850
- Think this is chalk?
- I don't know.

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:16.930
- I see the exit!
- The exit, the exit!

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:27.150
Would you look at that!

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:31.840
- Oh, wow...
- Look at that...

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.700
That's amazing.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:51.270
This goes a <i>long</i> way down...

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.720
Fena!

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:55.840
- Where do we go next?
- Down, I guess.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:57.720
Should've known...

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:08.950
Fena.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.340
There's a drop.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:18.590
I-I'm fine!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.510
Karin! Wait up!

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.540
Okay! Watch your step!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.010
Looks like we've reached
the bottom.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.360
Now then...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:41.020
Fena! Where do we
go from here?

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.640
That way!

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.150
What's with that color?

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.540
It makes everything look creepy.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:59.340
If they're dangerous, Tsubaki will
probably be the first to drop.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:00.620
Oh, good point.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.540
That guy is more sensitive
than a canary.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:06.040
This color can't be good
for your health...

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.880
So these are ancient ruins?

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.050
There's no sign
of anything alive here.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.400
Your intuition has gotten
awfully accurate.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.320
Yeah. Even I can tell that.

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:18.480
Is it like everything's
becoming clearer?

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:22.160
I guess. Ever since we came ashore,
all my doubts have been lifting.

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:27.310
So what's up with you
and Yukimaru?

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.120
N-Nothing at all!
Nothing!

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.070
- Understood.
- Nope! Nothing! Nosirree!

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:36.070
- Fine, I get it.
- Nothing! Not a thing, you hear?! Nada!

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:41.090
Is that it?

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.370
Yep. That narrow part there.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.310
I think that's the way in.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:49.630
- It's a long way down.
- Yeah.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.050
Um, guys?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.490
Come on, guys! I can't jump
down there from this high up!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.700
- Makaba, I can't--
- Yukimaru.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.870
Look after Fena, okay?

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:14.380
You're such a softie, Makaba.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.320
- That's for sure.
- What do you mean?

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:21.320
- Hold on tight.
- 'Kay!

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:25.380
Something tells me it's gonna be
a while before they come down.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.270
Er, thanks.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:38.090
- Kaede! Enju! Wait for me!
- Sure, sure...

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:39.880
You've got a long way to go.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.480
This is it.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:52.710
- Isn't this a little too easy?
- Yes, it is.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.610
What do you think?

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:58.960
Fena?

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:00.740
Don't worry.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.260
C'mon.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:20.590
I can't believe it! To think
this place really exists!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:24.010
The lost treasure is there?

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.830
It is.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:29.100
This will merit far more
than just a medal!

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:33.330
I'll put together
a landing party right away.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.490
Hm?

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:47.510
These walls,
they're nothing but books.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:53.000
Hey, you're right.
Look at all of 'em!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.350
They all look like they'd fall apart
if you touched 'em, though.

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:59.010
- Oh, no way...
- What's up, Karin?

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:02.360
- Nah, it couldn't be.
- <i>What</i> couldn't be?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:07.780
Well, if these are the 100,000 lost volumes
from the Library of Alexandria,

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.390
- that would be a real treasure--
- Guys.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.320
Um, how are we supposed
to open this?

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:35.290
It looks like the one
that was in Orléans.

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:37.310
Fena.

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:41.450
From here on in,
we won't be needing any keys.

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:44.930
The only thing you require...

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.430
- ...is the calling.
- ...is the calling.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.630
Wh-What's that?!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.490
- Oh, wow.
- Seriously?

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:46.250
All of this is gold?
I've never seen so much before!

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.590
I bet this is enough
to actually swim in.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.240
You're a genius!
Wanna go for a dip?

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.010
Let's shall!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.450
One, two!

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:01.940
With just a handful like this,

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.420
I'd be able to throw them
the best wedding ever!

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:09.550
Is this a ducat gold coin?

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:12.270
This one's a gulden
gold coin from Hungary!

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:15.410
This dish look like it
came from the Far East.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.910
It's all from different places
and different times!

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:24.040
This place has treasure
from all around the world!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.210
Fena?

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.710
Is this... Is this where
I'm supposed to go?

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:50.940
Is this really what my father
wanted me to see?

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.730
What does your intuition tell you?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.220
Well, I...

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:57.590
No.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.960
- Fena!
- This isn't the place.

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:06.980
What is, then?

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.520
Hey, Fena!

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.650
<b>YASUKE</b>

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.990
That's--

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:34.260
Wh-What is this place?

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:39.240
Fena.

00:16:58.810 --> 00:16:59.930
Fena?

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.910
Hey, Fena!

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:03.410
She was here.

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:06.410
She also came here.

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:10.420
"Initium." "Finis."

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.920
The beginning... is initium.

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:39.570
The lattice stage.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.070
Fena?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:37.480
O shrine maiden, dance with abandon.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:54.430
More than golden...

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.440
...the land of the gods.

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:02.440
Up past there is Eden.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:06.950
The place of both the beginning
and ending.

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:28.880
The stairway to Eden...

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:37.500
Yukimaru.
